      "type": "translated_stanza",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "18. Among passionate persons stands conspicuous S'iva",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "alone, who took for himself half the body of his beloved,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "( and yet ) to whom there is none superior among passion-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "renouncing men, as one who has given up his attachment",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "to women; the rest of the people, smitten with the poison of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "the cobra-like and irresistible shafts of love, and therefore",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "",
