          "text": "flesh; but even we that know better do not give up sensual",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "objects which are complicated with a net of difficulties.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "Alas ! how mysterious is the influence of infatuation !",
